(11,'KEEP',[II,III],'theory','Equilibrium and polynomial modes of a trapped classical gas under fully supplied fluid equations','The full continuity, force and pressure evolution equations and polynomial ansatz are printed. Classical Boltzmann equilibrium/Gaussian normalization, ideal-gas pressure and polynomial differential eigenanalysis complete the work; contestants need not supply a specialized fluid closure.'),
