(14,'KEEP',[III,IV],'theory','Thermal effusion pressure imbalance and work between maintained-temperature tanks','The hole is explicitly much smaller than mean free paths. Maxwell thermal crossing flux gives the pressure ratio; molecular momentum transfer and heat/work accounting explain forces and the thermodynamic bound. A work-cycle choice must be stated rather than pretending heat Q alone fixes a unique work.'),
