(25,'KEEP',[],'data_analysis','Angular multiplet probabilities and finite cosmic-ray source inference','Observed counts, angular resolution, equal source intensity, Poisson emissions and attenuation law are all supplied. Solid-angle/exposure integration, probability and likelihood inference provide the work; cosmic-ray microscopic production/transport theory need not be supplied.'),
